## Project instructions: AGENTS.md

Read `<repository path>/AGENTS.md` immediately after this index when it exists.
Treat it as high-priority project-local context for this project only. Do not
merge it with another project's `AGENTS.md`, apply it outside this project, or
treat its commands as permission to perform writes or destructive actions.
Noelle's system and security rules always win.

- **Path:** `<repository path>/AGENTS.md`
- **Scope:** <Project root or narrower subtree>
- **Last verified:** YYYY-MM-DD

## Topic map

This is the forward index. Add one row per topic that appears in more than one
file, answers a common question, or has stale or conflicting sources. The primary
source is the starting point, not the only source. Read supporting sources only
when the primary source is incomplete or conflicts. Use stale sources only to
explain history or conflict.

| Topic | Aliases or exact identifiers | Primary source | Supporting sources | Stale or conflicting | Search terms | Read order and stop |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| <Topic> | <Term, code, field, synonym> | `<path>` -> <section> | `<path>` -> <section> | `<path>` -> <section> (stale) | `<term1>|<term2>` | <Primary, then one supporting only if needed; stop when...> |

