## Typed relationships

- `depends_on`: This project requires `<project or document>` for <reason>.
- `implements`: `<document or code>` implements `<contract or design>`.
- `read_before`: Read `<path>` before `<path>` for <reason>.
- `read_with`: Read `<path>` with `<path>` to preserve context.
- `supersedes`: `<current path>` replaces `<old path>`.
- `conflicts_with`: `<path>` disagrees with `<path>` on <topic>.

